<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis launched missile strikes on Riyadh airport, killing twelve people—including an airline captain—and wounding hundreds, prompting the airport’s closure and Saudi vows of a major response. The attacks were followed by Houthi threats to Saudi airspace and warnings that they could target other Saudi airports. Yemeni government forces reported advancing against the Houthis, while fighting spread to Yemen’s capital and other cities. The EU condemned the attack, describing it as part of Iran‑backed proxy aggression in the region. The conflict caused 918 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/10/yemen-government-allied-forces-recapture-bab-al-mandab-strait-houthis-taiz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/10/yemeni-governments-military-says-its-forces-advancing-against-houthis?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/09/houthi-missile-strikes-kill-three-at-riyadh-airport-including-airline-captain&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOdDhPMXY4T05UWl9RU3MyLW96a1VXX0pZcmg5bjNBQ2RyajB6VjNud0lER0otSzJyWm9LMTVMYVdENzVCenA1VmxXaGZiaHVtck1vOWJSX3BnTkZsSktaZUZ1X2dvZFdnc3I4S0hLaTFXOXY0TXM0dVdpWlpXeTRfa1pLVlpqc193bTY2bFJKNlJDQjZHSjBJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPR094dC1TQTlURWVUOFpLQUc0a1kxa1cwM1h5aDQ3bmxzdk9jdk50VU9UaEVNbjFtVHpWNGZ5STNpeFB2RlJBUGxheVYza29vbnowUXMzYUh5VmVzTVR2WjhFQjU5M0RlZE9DWkI0UGtCZDEtMF9wUG9vcmtPalI1REsxYXNOYzhNNTJmaGh6Y2tVdVF6Z2F2WXdWMHEtbC11R1dXdnpyZmhkZmQtNWNpZFBvM2tkeS01WC1oRVVfRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles